{"id":"5f5a8e9f9701c56f","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-zfc-game3-information-set.md","title":"ZFC Game3 Information Set","display":"df-zfc-game3-information-set — ZFC Game3 Information Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-game3-information-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-game3-information-set"],"display":"df-zfc-game3-information-set — ZFC Game3 Information Set","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-game3-information-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-game3-information-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-game3-information-set — ZFC Game3 Information Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f4bf86f66c1444da\" href=\"?note=f4bf86f66c1444da\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence\">../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> (nonempty move set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> (prefix-closed history tree)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> (player map on nonterminal histories)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> (player)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\subseteq H\">\\(I\\subseteq H\\)</span> (information set candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FinSeq}\">\\(\\mathrm{FinSeq}\\)</span> (finite-sequence predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f4bf86f66c1444da\" href=\"?note=f4bf86f66c1444da\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence\">../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (three-place function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGame3InformationSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGame3InformationSet}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game3\\text{-}information\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcGame3InformationSet}_S(H,P,i,I)\\leftrightarrow\\exists M,D\\;\\Bigl(M\\neq\\varnothing\\land H\\subseteq\\{s:\\mathrm{FinSeq}(s,M)\\}\\land\\varnothing\\in H\\land\\forall h\\in H\\;\\forall n\\leq|\\operatorname{dom}(h)|\\;(h\\upharpoonright n\\in H)\\land D=\\{h\\in H:\\exists a\\in M\\;(h^\\frown\\langle a\\rangle\\in H)\\}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(P,D,\\{0,1\\})\\land i\\in\\{0,1\\}\\land\\varnothing\\neq I\\subseteq D\\land\\forall h\\in I\\;(P(h)=i)\\land\\forall h,k\\in I\\;\\bigl(\\{a\\in M:h^\\frown\\langle a\\rangle\\in H\\}=\\{a\\in M:k^\\frown\\langle a\\rangle\\in H\\}\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game3\\text{-}information\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcGame3InformationSet}_S(H,P,i,I)\\leftrightarrow\\exists M,D\\;\\Bigl(M\\neq\\varnothing\\land H\\subseteq\\{s:\\mathrm{FinSeq}(s,M)\\}\\land\\varnothing\\in H\\land\\forall h\\in H\\;\\forall n\\leq|\\operatorname{dom}(h)|\\;(h\\upharpoonright n\\in H)\\land D=\\{h\\in H:\\exists a\\in M\\;(h^\\frown\\langle a\\rangle\\in H)\\}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(P,D,\\{0,1\\})\\land i\\in\\{0,1\\}\\land\\varnothing\\neq I\\subseteq D\\land\\forall h\\in I\\;(P(h)=i)\\land\\forall h,k\\in I\\;\\bigl(\\{a\\in M:h^\\frown\\langle a\\rangle\\in H\\}=\\{a\\in M:k^\\frown\\langle a\\rangle\\in H\\}\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The definition now guards the history tree, the domain and codomain of the player map, the decision-node condition, and the common feasible-action set.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"f4bf86f66c1444da","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"f4bf86f66c1444da","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FinSeq}$ (finite-sequence predicate, see [[../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerp